function openEquipment(cls,id){if(!active)return;setView('static');$('staticType').value=cls;for(const e of ['staticArea','staticSite','staticVoltage'])$(e).value='';$('staticSearch').value=id;renderStatic(true);let t=active.t(cls),ix=active.index.get(cls)?.get(id);if(ix!==undefined){let row=active.enriched(cls,ix);showStaticDetail(cls,row);}}
function wireDetail(root){$$('[data-equip]',root).forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let [cl,id]=b.dataset.equip.split('|');openEquipment(cl,id)});$$('[data-showmap]',root).forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{selectSite(b.dataset.showmap);setMapMode('geo');setView('map');focusSite(b.dataset.showmap);});$$('[data-showscheme]',root).forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{selectSite(b.dataset.showscheme);setMapMode('scheme');setView('map');});$$('[data-showline]',root).forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{selectLine(b.dataset.showline);setMapMode('geo');setView('map');focusLine(b.dataset.showline);});$$('[data-sitecat]',root).forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>showStationNested(b.dataset.sid,b.dataset.sitecat));}
function showStationNested(sid,cls){let el=$('stationNested');if(!el)return;let rows=active.getEquipmentForSite(sid,cls),shown=rows.slice(0,70);el.innerHTML=`<b>${h(CATEGORY[cls]?.label||cls)} · ${nf.format(rows.length)} kayıt</b><div class="scrolltbl" style="max-height:240px"><table><thead><tr><th>FID</th><th>Ad</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody>${shown.map(r=>`<tr><td>${h(r.FID)}</td><td>${h(r.loc_name)}</td><td>${equipmentBtn(cls,r.FID,'Detay')}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>${rows.length>70?'<span class="mini">İlk 70 kayıt gösterildi; tamamı için envanter filtresini kullanın.</span>':''}`;wireDetail(el);}

function dynamicClasses(kind){switch(kind){case'production':case'voltage':return ['ElmSym','ElmGenStat'];case'load':return ['ElmLod'];case'tap':return ['ElmTr2'];case'switch':return ['ElmCoup'];case'line':return ['ElmLne'];case'shunt':return ['ElmShnt'];default:return [];}}
function dynRows(refilter=true){if(!active)return[];if(!refilter)return dynState.rows;let m=models[+$('dynModel').value]||active,kind=dynState.cat,site=$('dynSite').value,search=norm($('dynSearch').value.trim());let result=[];for(const cls of dynamicClasses(kind)){const t=m.t(cls);if(!t)continue;let fi=m.attrAt(cls,'FID'),ni=m.attrAt(cls,'loc_name');for(let i=0;i<t.Values.length;i++){let raw=t.Values[i],id=String(raw[fi]||''),name=String(raw[ni]||'');if(search&&!norm(id+' '+name).includes(search))continue;
 if(site){if(cls==='ElmLne'){let line=m.lineById(id);if(line?.stationA!==site&&line?.stationB!==site)continue;}else if(cls==='ElmTr2'){let r=m.row(cls,i);if(m.siteFromCub(r.bushv)!==site&&m.siteFromCub(r.buslv)!==site)continue;}else if(m.resolveSiteByClass(cls,id,raw,m.attrAt(cls,'fold_id'))!==site)continue;}
 let r=m.enriched(cls,i);r.__cls=cls;result.push(r);}}
 dynState.rows=result;dynState.page=0;return result;}
function renderDyn(refilter=true){if(!active){$('dynTable').innerHTML='<div class="empty">Önce JSON dosyası yükleyin.</div>';return;}let m=models[+$('dynModel').value]||active;let rows=dynRows(refilter);let cols=LABEL_DYN[dynState.cat]||['FID','loc_name'];let start=dynState.page*cfg.pageSize,part=rows.slice(start,start+(+cfg.pageSize));renderRows('dynamic','dynTable',part,cols,'mixed',0,(r,el)=>{dynState.selected=r;$$('tbody tr',$('dynTable')).forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('selected'));el.classList.add('selected');showDynDetail(r);});putText('dynStats',`${DYN_CATS.find(x=>x[0]===dynState.cat)?.[1]||''} · ${nf.format(rows.length)} eşleşen kayıt · ${m.date} ${m.time} · Model girdisi / konfigürasyon`);pager('dynPager',dynState,()=>renderDyn(false));$$('[data-kind]',$('dynKinds')).forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.kind===dynState.cat));$('seriesChart').classList.add('hidden');}
